  "referenceNumber": "SUD0070",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State has reasonable grounds to suspect that Mustafa Abdullah Ahmed \nSHENIBAT\n is an involved person under the Sudan (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2020\n \nbecause he is or has been involved in a relevant activity. He is responsible for or provided support for the commission of violations of international humanitarian law in Sudan, including \nrape and other forms of sexual and gender-based violence \nthrough his role as a Colonel of the Rapid Support Forces during its “takeover” of the Zamzam Internally Displaced Persons Camp in April 2025.\n \n",
